Task: prepare web client demo with real auth
Context:
- Public demo should authenticate against the real API; defaulting to seed data is unacceptable.
Position:
- Require HTTPS-only URLs (except localhost) and JWKS-backed JWT verification before any remote sync; block startup when `apiBaseUrl`/OIDC config is missing.
- Generate runtime-config.js at container start from env so deployments don’t drift; ensure health checks are set on App Service.
Recommendations:
- Pair with backend to validate `/state` semantics; adjust the adapter quickly if API shape changes.
- Add staging smoke to exercise auth redirect + JWKS retrieval to catch issuer or secret drift before release.
